      "单细胞RNA测序工作流程参数说明": "Cells were filtered using cutoffs for number of genes detected per cell (between 200 to 5000), percent mitochondrial gene expression per cell (less than 20%), and expression of housekeeping genes. Variable gene selection (top 2000), dimensionality reduction using principal components analysis, Leiden clustering on a shared nearest neighbor graph, and UMAP visualization were performed. Cell types were annotated using a combination of differentially expressed genes, copy-number aberrations, and similarity scores to transcriptional profiles of bulk RNA-seq from sarcomas. Tools used include Cumulus, Seurat, scran, and inferCNV.",
